    "title": "CCPS Leadership Announcing New Hires In Coming Days - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By News Edge Newsroom ,\n8 hours ago Officials with Christian County Public Schools have plans for major job announcements over the next week. This Friday at 10 AM, local media outlets and district employees will be on hand at the Glass Avenue Central Office for the reveal of the new Christian County High School Tigers band director — and details will be shared about the future of the Tiger Band program. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
